Package: ptexr
Type: Package
Title: Per-Face Texture Mapping for 3D Rendering
Version: 2.5.4-1
Authors@R: c(
    person("Tyler", "Morgan-Wall", email = "tylermw@gmail.com",
        role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
        comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-3131-3814")),
    person("Disney Enterprises, Inc.", role = c("aut", "cph"),
        comment = "Ptex library"))
Description: Reads, writes, and filters per-face textures using 'Ptex'
    <https://github.com/wdas/ptex>. Stores textures on individual mesh faces
    without a global texture atlas. Provides filtering across face
    boundaries, shared texture caches, and a native runtime interface.
